1 EVEN JOHN D. McFARLAND OBITUARY     After a lingering illness John D.(sic) McFarland died at his home in Syracuse, Nebraska, Thursday, August 16th, 1906, a little after 12 o’clock noon.    He was 54 years old and was born in Monroe County, Ohio, and se
2 CONC ttled in Otoe county over thirty years ago.  He leaves a wife and three sons, Will of this place, Etson of Nebraska City, ad John who is located in California.   The funeral was held Friday from the Baptist Church in which faith he had been conver
2 CONC ted a short time ago, the services being conducted by Rev. Brady after which the interment took place in the Park Hill Cemetery.    The bereaved have the sympathy of a host of friends.       Syracuse Journal-Democrat, 23 August, 1906, page 4.
2 TYPE LifeSketch
2 SOUR @S665@
