5 CONC , brother, John G. Askey of Wentzville, MO, nine grandchildren and 21 great-grandchildren. She is preceded in death by her husband, Elmer E. Garrett, parents: Jay Askey and Bessie Askey (nee Ackerman), son, Bob "Butch" Garrett, four brothers, tw
5 CONC o sisters and granddaughter, Ellen Fry. Mrs. Garrett worked for Beacon Shoe Company and sold Avon. She was a member of Eagles in Herman. She will be dearly missed by all who knew her     Burial:  Jonesburg City Cemetery  Jonesburg  Montgomery Coun
