1 CONC Esther Mae Askey May 2, 1921 November 17, 2013 Esther Mae Askey, 92, of Howard, passed away Sunday, Nov. 17, 2013, at her home in Marsh Creek. She was born in Plunketts Run, Mill Hall on May 2, 1921, a daughter of the late Boyd and Grace Muthler P
1 CONC hillips. Esther is the last of her generation having been preceded in death by her siblings, Evelyn Heimer, Blanche Peter and Eldon Phillips. She married Harold E. Askey on Oct. 30, 1937. Harold died at home Oct. 9, 1993. Esther was a homemaker o
1 CONC n the Askey farm for some 70 plus years, raising seven children. In addition to her love and dedication to her children, she worked extra hard and many long hours to make the house a home for the family. She also worked at Bobbie Brooks in Lock Ha
1 CONC ven and Woolrich in Howard. Esther enjoyed many things during her lifetime; cooking, baking, fudge making, gardening and canning, berry picking, quilting and crocheting, bus trips and Sunday sightseeing, and tenderly caring for her flowers. She lo
1 CONC ved flowers of all kinds. She especially loved to decorate the farm house for Christmas and other holidays. And, the welcome mat was always out for family and friends. Esther attended the Romola Bible Church. She is survived by three daughters, Ru
1 CONC th (Joe) Carter and Marilyn (Marlin) Martin, of Howard, and Vonda (Henry) Weight, of Mingoville; a daughter-in-law, Fran Askey, of Howard; two sons, Russell and Wayne (Susan) Askey; and a son-in-law, Dick Matis, all of Howard; 17 grandchildren; an
1 CONC d many great grandchildren and great-great grandchildren. She was preceded in death by a daughter, Jane Matis, who died August 13, 1998; a son, Randy, who died Jan. 30, 2013; and a granddaughter, Neva Askey, who died Jan. 31, 1995. The funeral ser
1 CONC vice will be held at 11 a.m. on Wednesday, Nov. 20, 2013, at Kader-Neff Funeral Home, 135 W. Main St., Howard, with Pastor Robert Mauer officiating. Burial will be at Romola Christian Cemetery in Howard. Visitation will be from 6-8 p.m. Tuesday, N
1 CONC ov. 19, 2013. - See more at: http://www.legacy.com/obituaries/centredaily/obituary.aspx?n=Esther-Askey&pid=168094281#sthash.xhCY7lQC.dpuf
1 CONT
1 CONT Read more here: http://www.legacy.com/obituaries/centredaily/obituary.aspx?n=Esther-Askey&pid=168094281#storylink=cpy
