1 CONC Kennedy-Askey, Kimberly
1 CONT Kim, 57 passed away unexpectedly at home on July 13, 2011. Kim's sweet soul can now join her father, Calvin Askey and her mother Carol Askey. Kim is survived by her husband: Christopher (Kit) Kennedy & mother-in-law MaryK Kennedy & family of Phoen
1 CONC ix, Az.; brothers: Terry Askey & wife Debra Askey of Phoenix, Az.; Scott Askey & wife Amanda Askey of Albuquerque, NM.; Aunts: Jeanne Keller of Cuyahoga Falls, OH.; Margie Bodley of Syracuse, NY. Kim's love for her nieces and nephews was infinite
1 CONC , she considered them as if they were her own children. Nephews: Donnie, Marcus and Mike.; Nieces: Jody, Nikki, Miranda, Haley and (soul sister) Taylor. Kim's role model for life was the unconditional love of her animals, and she loved them,wit
1 CONC h a passion. "Good night sweet princess". You will be deeply missed. Donations can be made to the ASPCA or HALO animal rescue Phoenix, Az 602-971-9222
