1 CONC Cumberland County, Pennsylvania, USA Death: Jan., 1851, Pike Township (Clearfield County), Clearfield County, Pennsylvania, USA
1 CONT Robert was one of the first settlers of Clearfield County, PA. He was married in 1801 to Mary "Polly" Evans. They homesteaded on the west bank of the Susquehanna River about 3 miles north of what is now Curwensville in Pike Township, Clearfield Co
1 CONC unty, PA. He made some of the first clearings in the area. They had twelve children.
1 CONT Robert fought in the Indian Wars in Ohio and in the War of 1812.
