1 CONT
1 CONT Doral “Tom” Askins, 86, died Thursday, April 17, 2008 in El Cajon Calif. Mr. Askins was born March 4, 1922, the son of Ray and Etta Morgan Askins. He attended Pittsburg schools.  In 1942, he enlisted in the Coast Guard and was honorably discharge
1 CONC d in 1946. He married Betty Jane Juimet in 1943. She preceded him in death in 1997.
1 CONT
1 CONT He was a cement finisher for Askins Construction Co. In 1950 they moved to San Diego.  He is survived by two sons, Gary, and wife Pat of Norman, Okla., Wayne, and wife Nancy of Lakeside, Calif., one daughter, Cindy and husband Dan Helm, Lakeside
1 CONC ; one sister Lucretia (Doll) Lightkep of Salt Spring, FL., and one brother Dalton, and wife Birdie Askins of Frontenac; six grandchildren and numerous great grandchildren, nieces and nephews. He was preceded in death by his parents, brother, Merl
1 CONC e Askins and wife Helen and sister, Mae Hall and husband Keith. Funeral services was held April 22, 2008 in Lakeside, Calif. Arrangements were made by Greenwood Mortuary, San Diego, Calif.
