2 _TEXT At the time of her death Zoe Bow was living in Alpine Texas with her husband Robert Alexander Bow much had gone on vacation with a family friend to Colorado.  The family friend, Estelle Middleton wife of Johnny Middleton, was an old friend of th
3 CONC e Bows having been Jack Bow's first grade teacher.  Mrs. Middleton and her husband had also resided with the Bows at one time.  Mrs. Middleton, her daughter, and Mrs. Bow had driven together from Texas to a vacation property the Middleton's owne
3 CONC d in Colorado the day of her death.  When they arrived Mrs. Bow complained that she did not feel well and she went to lie down and the house while her two companions unloaded the car.  When the Middleton's went to check on her later they found he
3 CONC r dead.  Because the vacation home was in a remote area the two women loaded Mrs. Bow back into their car and drove her to the nearest hospital in LaJara, Colorado where she was pronounced dead.
